hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"530","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' sab sey behtar din jis mein suraj nikla, Juma ka din hai, isi din Adam ko paida kya gaya, isi din unhen jannat mein dakhil kya gaya, isi din unhen jannat sey nikala gaya, aur qiyamat bhi isi din qaaim hogi '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Lubaba, Salman , Abu-Zar , Saad bin Ubada aur Aus bin Aus (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"531","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Juma key roz us ghadi ko jismein dua ki qubuliyat ki ummid ki jati hai Asr sey ley kar suraj doobney tak key darmiyan talash karo ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, 2- ye hadees Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi kaee sanadon sey marvi hai, 3- Muhammad bin abi Humed zaeef maaney jatey hain, baaz ehle-ilm ney unkey hifz key talluq sey un ki tazeef ki hai, unhen Hammad bin abi Humed bhi kaha jata hai, neez kaha jata hai ke yehi abu Ibrahim Ansari hain aur ye munkire-hadees hain, 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka khayal hai ke ye ghadi jis mein qubuliyate-dua ki ummid ki jati hai Asr key baad sey suraj doobney key darmiyan hai, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi kehtey hain. Ahmed kehtey hain : is ghadi key silsiley mein jis mein dua ki qubuliyat ki ummid ki jati hai ziyada tar hadisein yehi aai hain ke ye Asr key baad sey suraj doobney key darmiyan hai, neez suraj dhalney key baad bhi uskey honey ki ummid ki jati hai."
"532","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Juma main eik ghadi aisi hai ke banda jo kuch bhi is mein maangta hai Allah usey ata karta hai'' , logon ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! ye kon si ghadi hai? aap ney farmaya : '' namaz ( Juma ( khadi honey key waqt sey ley kar us sey palatney yani namaz khatam honey tak hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Amr bin Auf ki hadees Hasan gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Musa , Abu-Zar , Salman , Abdullah bin Salam , abu-Lubaba, Saad bin Ubada aur abu-Umama (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"533","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sab sey behtar din jis mein suraj nikla Jume ka din hai. isi din Adam paida kiye gaey, isi din wo jannat mein dakhil kiye gaey, isi din wo jannat sey (zameen par utarey gaey) is din main eik ghadi aisi hai ke jisey Muslim banda namaz ki haalat mein paey aur Allah sey is mein kuchh talab karey to Allah usey zarur ata farmaeyga. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : phir main Abdullah bin Salam sey mila aur un sey is hadees ka zikr kiya to unhoney kaha : main ye ghadi achchhi tarah janta hun, mainey kaha : mujhey bhi uskey barey mein bataiye aur is silsiley mein mujh sey bukhl (kanjoosi) na keejiye, unhoney kaha : ye Asr key baad sey ley kar suraj doobney ke darmiyan hai, is par mainey kaha : ye Asr ke baad kaisey ho sakti hai jabke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : ''usey musalman banda haalate namaz mein paey aur ye waqt aisa hai jis mein namaz nahin padhi jati? to Abdullah bin Salam ney kaha : kya Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ye nahin farmaya hai ke jo shakhs namaz key intizar mein kisi jagah betha rahey to wo bhi namaz hi mein hota hai? mainey kaha : kyon nahin, zarur farmaya hai to unhoney kaha : to yehi murad hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees main eik taweel (lamba) qissa hai. 2- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 3- aur aap ke is qol (أخبرني بها wala تضنن بها علي) key maana hain \isey mujhey bataaney mein bukhl na keejiye.\""  «ضنّ» key maana bukhl (kanjoosi) ke hain aur «"""
"534","unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : '' jo Juma ki namaz key liye aaye usey chahiye ke) pehley ( ghusl kar ley '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- is baat mein umr , abu Saeed Khudri , Jabir , Bara , Aaisha aur Abu-Darda sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"535","neez ibn Shahab Zohri sey ye hadees b-tareeq : الزهري an عبد الله بن عبد الله بن عمر an أبيه an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم bhi marvi hai, Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain : Zohri ki hadees jisey unhoney b-tareeq : « Salim an Abeeh Abdullah bin umr »riwayat ki hai aur jo hadees unhoney b-tareeq : « Abdullah bin Abdullah bin umr an Abeeh Abdullah bin umr » riwayat ki hai dono hadisein sahih hain, aur Zohri key baaz talaamiza ney isey b-tareeq : «Zohri an aal abdullah bin umr an abdullah bin umr » riwayat ki hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Juma key din key ghusl key silsiley mein b-tareeq : « ibne-Umar an umr an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » marfooan marvi hai, ( jo aagey aa rahi hai) aur ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"536","umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Juma key roz khutba dey rahey they ke usi doran Sahaba mein sey eik shakhs padhi. ( masjid mein) dakhil huye, to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney puchha : ye kon sa waqt ( aaney ka ( hai? to unhoney kaha : mainey sirf itni der ki ke Azan suni aur bas wuzu kar key aa gaya hun, is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : tum ney sirf ( wuzu hi par iktifa kya ( halanke tumhen malum hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ghusl ka hukm diya hai?"
"537","Zohri sey yehi hadees marvi hai. aur Malik ney bhi ye hadees b-tareeq : « an Zohri an Salim riwayat ki hai, wo Salim bin umr kehtey hain ke umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Juma key din khutba dey rahey they, aagey unhoney puri hadees zikr ki . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : mainey is silsiley mein Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey puchha to unhoney kaha : sahih Zohri ki hadees hai jisey unhoney b-tareeq : « Salim an Abiy » riwayat ki hai. Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain ke Malik sey bhi usi hadees ki tarah marvi hai, unhoney b-tareeq : « Zohri an Salim an Abeeh » bhi riwayat ki hai."
"538","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney Juma key din ghusl kya aur ghusl karaya , aur sawerey pahuncha , shuru sey khutbey mein shareek raha , Imam key qarib betha aur ghor sey khutba suna aur khamosh raha to usey uskey har qadam key badley eik saal key rozey aur raat key qiyam ka sawab milega ''. Wakee kehtey hain : uska maana hai ke usney khud ghusl kya aur apni aurat ko bhi ghusl karaya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aus bin Aus ki hadees Hasan hai, padhi. - Abdullah bin Mubarak ney is hadees key silsiley mein kaha hai ke « man ghasala w aghtasil» key maana hain : jisney apna sar dhoya aur ghusl kya, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Bakar , Imran bin Husain , Salman , Abu-Zar , abu-Saeed , ibne-Umar , aur abu-Ayyub (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"539","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney Juma key din wuzu kya to usney rukhsat ko ikhtiyar kya aur khub hai ye rukhsat , aur jisney ghusl kya to ghusl afzal hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai, padhi. - Qatada key baaz talaamiza ney to ye hadees Qatada sey aur Qatada ney Hasan Basri sey aur Hasan Basri ney Samra bin Jundub sey) marfooan ( riwayat ki hai. aur baaz ney Qatada sey aur Qatada ney Hasan sey aur Hasan ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursalan riwayat ki hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , Aaisha aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 4- Sahaba kiram aur unkey baad key ehle-ilm ka amal isi par hai, unhoney Juma key din key ghusl ko pasand kya hai, unka khayal hai ke ghusl key badley wuzu bhi kafi ho jaeyga, 5- Shafai kehtey hain : Juma key roz Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key ghusl key hukm key wajib honey key bajaey ikhtiyari honey par jo cheezen dalalat karti hain un mein sey umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees bhi hai jis mein unhoney Usman (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha hai ke tum ney sirf wuzu par iktifa kya hai halanke tumhen malum hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Juma key din ghusl ka hukm diya hai, agar unhen ye malum hota ke ye hukm waajibii hai, ikhtiyari nahin to umr (Raziallahu anhu) Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ko lotaye baghair na chhodtey aur un sey kehtey : jaao ghusl karo, aur na hi Usman (Raziallahu anhu) sey is baat key janney key bawajud ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Juma ko ghusl karney ka hukm diya hai uskey"
"540","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam farmaya : '' jisney wuzu kya aur achi tarah kya padhi. phir Juma key liye aaya padhi. , Imam key qarib betha , ghor sey khutba suna aur khamosh raha to uskey us Juma sey ley kar doosrey Juma tak key aur mazeed teen din key gunah bakhsh diye jaeyngey, aur jisney kankariyaan hataain to usney fuzul kam kya''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"541","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney Juma key roz janabat key ghusl ki tarah ( yani khub ehtimam sey) ghusl kya phir namaz Juma key liye ( pehli ghadi mein) gaya to goya usney eik oont Allah ki raah mein qurban kya, aur jo uskey baad wali ghadi mein gaya to goya usney eik gaey qurban ki, aur jo teesri ghadi mein gaya to goya usney eik seengon wala mendha qurban kya aur jo chauthi ghadi mein gaya to goya usney eik murghi ka sadqa karkey Allah ka taqarrub hasil kya, aur jo paanchwin ghadi mein gaya to goya usney eik anda Allah ki raah mein sadqa kya, phir jab Imam khutbey key liye ghar sey nikal aaya to farishtey zikr sunney key liye hazir ho jatey hain padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr aur Samra (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"542","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo Juma teen baar susti padhi. sey haqeer jaan kar chhod dega to Allah uskey dil par mohar laga dega ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- abul-Ja'd ki hadees Hasan hai, 2- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey abul-Ja'd Zamri ka naam puchha to wo nahin jaan sakey , 3- is hadees key ilawa mein un ki koi aur hadees nahin janta jisey unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki ho, 4- hum is hadees ko sirf Muhammad bin Amr ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"543","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen hukm diya ke hum qubaa sey aa kar Juma mein shareek hon. is silsiley mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat ki gaee hai, wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain, lekin ye sahih nahin hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko ham sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, aur is baab mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi koi chiz sahih nahin hai, 2- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Juma is par farz hai jo raat ko apney ghar walon tak pahunch sakey '' , is hadees ki sanad zaeef hai, ye hadees Muaarik bin Ibaad sey riwayat ki jati hai aur Muaarik Abdullah bin Saeed Maqbari sey riwayat kartey hain, Yahya bin Saeed Qataan ney Abdullah bin Saeed Maqbari ki hadees ki tazeef ki hai, padhi. 3- ehle-ilm ka is mein ikhtilaf hai ke Juma kis par wajib hai, baaz kehtey hain : Juma us shakhs par wajib hai jo raat ko apney ghar pahunch sakey aur baaz kehtey hain : Juma sirf usi par wajib hai jisney Azan suni ho, Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai."
